OL,3,GNEWSAReview of maternity cases nearly
OL,4,Acomplete - police
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice say they have almost finished
OL,7,Freviewing whether a crime may have been
OL,8,Fcommitted in more than 500 cases of
OL,9,Fmaternity care at hospitals in
OL,10,FNottingham.
OL,12,FNottinghamshire Police's ongoing
OL,13,Finvestigation is looking into deaths
OL,14,Fand serious injuries related to
OL,15,Fmaternity care at Nottingham City
OL,16,FHospital and Nottingham Queen's Medical
OL,17,FCentre ` both run by the Nottingham
OL,18,FUniversity Hospitals NHS Trust (NUH).
