OL,3,GNEWSAReview of maternity cases nearly
OL,4,Acomplete - police
OL,5,
OL,6,FOperation Perth was launched in 2023 to
OL,7,Fwork alongside the largest maternity
OL,8,Finquiry in the history of the NHS, led
OL,9,Fby Donna Ockenden.
OL,11,FIn an update to families on Saturday,
OL,12,FSupt Matthew Croome, said the force had
OL,13,Fin the past month received the
OL,14,Fremaining family folders from the
OL,15,FOckenden review.
